==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|?}}

# {{pathology}} A highly [[infectious]] disease of the upper [[respiratory tract]] characterised by a sore throat, fever, and difficulty breathing. Its effects are due to a potent [[toxin]] secreted by a [[bacterium]].

====Derived terms====
* [[diphtherial]]
* [[diphtheric]]
* [[diphtheritic]]

